# Two x-rail tickets: unsigned base64url JSON, expiring in 2100, in the nested
# shape Rail Center stores: `id`, `posture.overall.{score,level}`, `alignment`.
# `skills` carries the full key Rail Center mints, `<slug>#<path>#<method>#<call>`.
# The low-score ticket's `id` is what its denial must carry as `ticket_id`.
E2E_GOOD_
E2E_LOW_SCORE_
